# Backend-only. Do NOT prefix this with VITE_ — that would bundle it into
# the client-side JavaScript and expose it to anyone using the app.
#
# Read server-side only, by api/ai/interpret.js (a Vercel Function), to
# call Groq on the app's behalf for voice commands the local parser
# couldn't understand. Optional: if this is unset, or Groq is unreachable
# or times out, that endpoint returns an "unknown" result instead of
# erroring, and NOMA falls back to its normal deterministic voice
# commands — nothing about the app requires this key.
GROQ_API_KEY=
